dialect protocol stdio.semio.video.diff
; encode_diff is the UTF-8 bytes of print_diff verbatim (protocol::DiffCodec's own documented
; simplification, matching GifDiff/SvgDiff/DocxDiff) — no separate binary layout. See the sibling
; 📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio for the normative text grammar these bytes decode as.
body = UTF8-OCTET *
